  "body": "The spec seems ambiguous as to wether `<img>` as child of `<template>` should load image resources of `src` and `srcset`. \r\n\r\nTest case: https://codepen.io/oscarotero/pen/PQyZEJ\r\n\r\n * Safari, it doesn't load.\r\n * Chrome, it doesn't load.\r\n * Firefox, it does ([bug 1441044f](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1441044)). \r\n",
